---
import Terminal from '../layouts/Terminal.astro';
---

<Terminal title="about">
	<p class="cmd">man infrashift</p>

	<article class="man">
		<header class="man-head dim">
			<span>INFRASHIFT(7)</span>
			<span>Organization Manual</span>
			<span>INFRASHIFT(7)</span>
		</header>

		<h2>NAME</h2>
		<p>infrashift - trusted infrastructure, built in the open</p>

		<h2>SYNOPSIS</h2>
		<p><b>infrashift</b> [<i>--secure</i>] [<i>--reproducible</i>] [<i>--boring</i>]</p>

		<h2>DESCRIPTION</h2>
		<p>
			infrashift builds the unglamorous foundations that platform teams depend on: base images,
			development environments, policy, and automation. We aim for software that is verifiable,
			reproducible, and easy to operate.
		</p>
		<p>
			Security and compliance are shifted left into the tools engineers already use, rather than
			bolted on at the end.
		</p>

		<h2>SEE ALSO</h2>
		<p><a href="/projects/">projects</a>(1), <a href="/contact/">contact</a>(1)</p>
	</article>
</Terminal>

<style>
	.man-head {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1ch;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0.25rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--magenta);
	}

	.man p {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 4ch;
		color: var(--fg-dim);
	}

	b {
		color: var(--fg);
	}

	i {
		font-style: normal;
		color: var(--yellow);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.man-head span:nth-child(2) {
			display: none;
		}

		.man p {
			margin-left: 2ch;
		}
	}
</style>
